#. module: account_mass_reconcile
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_mass_reconcile.account_mass_reconcile_form
msgid ""
"Match multiple debit vs multiple credit entries. Allow partial "
"reconciliation. The lines should have the same partner, and the credit entry"
" ref. is matched with the debit entry ref. or name."
msgstr ""
"Bat etorri zordunketa anitzeko idazpenak kreditu anitzeko idazpenekin. Onartu partzialki uztartzea. Lerroek bazkide bera eduki behar dute eta kreditu-idazpenaren erreferentziak bat etorri behar du zordunketa-idazpenaren erreferentzia edo izenarekin."

#. module: account_mass_reconcile
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_mass_reconcile.account_mass_reconcile_form
msgid ""
"Match one debit line vs one credit line. Do not allow partial "
"reconciliation. The lines should have the same amount (with the write-off) "
"and the same name to be reconciled."
msgstr ""
"Bat etorri zordunketa-lerro bat kreditu-lerro batekin. Ez onartu partzialki uztartzea. Lerroak uztartu ahal izateko, zenbateko (kenkaria barne) eta izen bera eduki behar dute."

#. module: account_mass_reconcile
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_mass_reconcile.account_mass_reconcile_form
msgid ""
"Match one debit line vs one credit line. Do not allow partial "
"reconciliation. The lines should have the same amount (with the write-off) "
"and the same partner to be reconciled."
msgstr ""
"Bat etorri zordunketa-lerro bat kreditu-lerro batekin. Ez onartu partzialki uztartzea. Lerroak uztartu ahal izateko, zenbateko (kenkaria barne) eta bazkide bera eduki behar dute."

#. module: account_mass_reconcile
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_mass_reconcile.account_mass_reconcile_form
msgid ""
"Match one debit line vs one credit line. Do not allow partial "
"reconciliation. The lines should have the same amount (with the write-off) "
"and the same reference to be reconciled."
msgstr ""
"Bat etorri zordunketa-lerro bat kreditu-lerro batekin. Ez onartu partzialki uztartzea. Lerroak uztartu ahal izateko, zenbateko (kenkaria barne) eta erreferentzia bera eduki behar dute."

